Upstream: https://github.com/prometheus-operator/prometheus-operator
Version: v1 (monitoring.coreos.com)

Hand-authored CRD stub sufficient for envtest-based integration tests
of the InferenceService PodMonitor reconciler (added in PR #158). The
stub preserves unknown fields (x-kubernetes-preserve-unknown-fields)
on .spec and .status so the controller's typed PodMonitor writes
succeed without modeling the full schema.

The prometheus-operator Go module
(github.com/prometheus-operator/prometheus-operator/pkg/apis/monitoring)
ships the Go types but not the CRD YAMLs, so this is hand-vendored
(same pattern as envoy-gateway).

Production correctness is NOT validated by this stub — the real
prometheus-operator does that on a live cluster.

To refresh from upstream:

  # On a machine with internet access:
  curl -fsSL \
    https://raw.githubusercontent.com/prometheus-operator/prometheus-operator/v0.79.2/example/prometheus-operator-crd/monitoring.coreos.com_podmonitors.yaml \
    > tests/integration/dep-crds/prometheus-operator/podmonitors.yaml
